      "role": "user",
      "content": "sometimes i feel like i dont even exist lol. i moved here months ago and i literally haven't had a real conversation with anyone. i walk through the streets and it's like people just look right through me. like im a ghost or something. what's even the point of trying if no one even notices you're there?",
